WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.110
- Well,, wait, this is gonna be,

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.280
is it 35 years?

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.240
- Yes.
- So you're about to celebrate

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.811
35 years together?
(audience cheers)

00:00:05.811 --> 00:00:08.970
That's incredible. That's incredible.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:10.860
I'm just saying it doesn't always happen,

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.180
especially for people in the business,

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.380
especially for two artists.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.940
Like that's incredible.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.590
Let me know like what your secret is.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:17.990
Maybe I'll use it next time.

00:00:19.189 --> 00:00:20.022
- We have no secret.

00:00:20.022 --> 00:00:20.855
- We have no secrets, yes.

00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:21.780
- Are y'all doing anything big?

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.070
Are you doing anything to celebrate?

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:26.130
- We don't usually do a big
thing for our anniversary.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.270
We usually like hang out
and go to dinner, you know?

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.680
I mean really we're-
- We make dinner.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.650
- Yeah, we're pretty boring.
- But that's nice.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.570
But I feel like our jobs
are always constantly going

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.403
and doing stuff,

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:39.180
so it's nice to do-
- Yes, exactly. Exactly.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.950
- I think we like, one of
the things we like about

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.870
our anniversary though I have to say is

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.190
that it falls in September

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.960
and I absolutely love the
month of September because-

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.730
- Ooh, fall in general.
- Yeah, I mean the light

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:52.730
is so beautiful and also for
some reason New Year's is,

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.567
you know, supposed to
be the start of the year

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:56.640
but it never feels like the
start of the year for me.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.633
September feels like when the
year starts, it's hopeful.

00:01:01.714 --> 00:01:02.547
- [Audience] Aww.

00:01:02.547 --> 00:01:03.380
- Do you think that coincides with like-

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:04.950
- Is that corny? I don't know.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.470
I wasn't even trying to elicit an "Aww"

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:09.000
but somehow
(audience laughs)

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.620
just talking about September got an "Aww."

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.860
- For my family it's because
I have kids, so like,

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.120
it's like school starts around then.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:17.550
So it feels like the school
year kind of starts for me too.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.590
In a totally non-romantic way.
(audience laughs)

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:21.300
Just that's when I buy school supplies.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.020
So that's what that is.

